        "[-4.0 dB] Transparent-gate absorption loophole: when c_t=0, r_1(t) can absorb D_1(t)=1 without immediate local contradiction",
        "[-4.5 dB] Depth-1 Right Cylinder has positive topological entropy (~0.32 bits/step) on short runs 1 <= a_i <= 7" ;
    pk:evidenceFor "[+1.5 dB] Depth-1 Right Cylinder kills sparse pulses (0^{Pi-1} 1)^infty in 1st period & bounds post-period survival <=19 steps",
        "[+2.5 dB] All-t_0 gate-lock infinite families via 3-bit right-wall trap W_3 (Thms 32, 37, 38, 40, 42)",
        "[+3.0 dB] Unconditional 4-line inward wavefront (D_1(t)=1 infinitely often) & D_2(t)=D_1(t+1)^D_1(t) (Thms 45, 47)",
        "[+3.5 dB] Pure Left-Cone causal functional B_t(m) & Pascal-Lucas Green's function (Thm 44)",
        "[+3.5 dB] Unconditional joint-seam (c_t, l_1(t)) impossibility for all t_0, Pi >= 1 (Thm 36(1))" ;
    pk:hasConfidence 7e-01 ;
    pk:hasProbability 1.18048e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "SHARP_REDUCTION_TO_PHASE_ALIGNMENT_OBSTRUCTION" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidenceDeciban 2.5e+00 .

